  "body": "The post-merge batch gate failed on `95e01ce28d8a21d53afd01daca5607d0aaac3a6d`.\n\nRun: https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/actions/runs/45456552955\n\nFailing steps:\n```\n  FAIL     1s  app suites: plunge_depth_tab  failed: tests/plunge_depth_tab.rs [tests: the_tabbed_contour_catalog_case_names_its_tab_window_dives]\n```\n\nEach push to main has its own run, so this run gates exactly this commit. If the run of the commit before it is green, this commit broke main. Fix it in the normal order; this issue closes itself on the next green run.\n\n<!-- post-merge-last-sha: d4601c6ea11653041a2c78352c46c4e1cd177513 -->",
